    {
      "id": "claim_83543f0a2d714fd7ab3dc7fdca9d2ed7",
      "statement": "Constitution amendments must follow the file's Governance procedure: a proposal documenting rationale, impact and migration plan; review and formal approval; a version bump where MAJOR signals a principle change, MINOR a guidance addition and PATCH a clarification; and alignment of existing code within one release cycle.",
