      "id": "claim_03665b1b11ac49259ed83ae3ca116794",
      "statement": "\"No Vibe Coding\" is a named AI Assistant Constraint requiring the assistant to always refer to the current `plan.md` and `spec.md` before writing code, with deviations requiring explicit documentation and approval — mirroring the constitution's own amendment discipline.",
