    {
      "id": "claim_bf259f1b431f4d8eb13f4a0b03e2db57",
      "statement": "The bounded web cold-load exception is enforced as a byte ceiling on the mcm-app web entry chunk (2,000,000 bytes against a measured 1,762,630) by `scripts/check-web-bundle-budget.mjs`, which also asserts that deferred packages are absent from the entry chunk and server-only code is absent from every client chunk.",
