    {
      "id": "claim_9244f3f44afe4c63be871d9efcf1da1f",
      "statement": "Constitution v2.6.0 is a MINOR, stack-guidance-only amendment that advances the frontend baseline from Expo SDK 56 to Expo SDK 57 (React Native 0.86, React 19.2); it redefines no principle, and it was drafted in the same pull request as the dependency bump it authorises, per the rule that a version the constitution names must be amended with human approval in the change that moves it.",
