      "id": "claim_04e9a8be56d7452c94ff7a1942862f6e",
      "statement": "Only a stack element the constitution names *with a version* forces an amendment when it moves; a library named without a version does not. The frontend stack section names Tamagui and `@mcm/design-system` as the UI/styling engine but pins no version for it, so a Tamagui major is not a constitutional change, whereas the Expo SDK/native runtime, the container images and the toolchain lines are version-named and are.",
