      "id": "claim_8db169fb6d434bbc8d3fad371dba0209",
      "statement": "Beyond principles and stack baselines the constitution carries the architecture diagrams that are the canonical picture of the runtime topology: two C4 container diagrams (multi-frontend/multi-service, and the additive AI-agents layer) and three auth-flow sequence diagrams (login, backend resource access, agent auth), the last of which specifies the RFC 8693 run-scoped subject-token exchange and downscoped backend token that keep token custody with the BFF.",
